2>\n<p>Use <code>variant=\"destructive\"</code> for irreversible actions.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;dropdown-menu-destructive&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"avatar\">Avatar</h2>\n<p>An account switcher dropdown triggered by an avatar.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;dropdown-menu-avatar&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"complex\">Complex</h2>\n<p>A richer example combining groups, icons, and submenus.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;dropdown-menu-complex&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;dropdown-menu-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://react-aria.adobe.com/Menu\">React Aria documentation</a> for the full API reference.</p>"
